                                        <h3>25 years of getting it right.</h3>
                    <div class=" content normal">
                        <p>Since 2000, TxODDS has been streaming fast, reliable odds to every corner of the world. Global teams, 24/7 support, zero tolerance for downtime.</p>
<p><strong>Price faster, hold more margin.</strong><br />
At 8-10ms, your feeds update before the market moves. That speed translates directly into margin your competitors leave behind.</p>
<p><strong>Tighter lines, less exposure.</strong><br />
Consensus pricing from multiple sources closes the spread before it can be exploited. Your book stays balanced without manual intervention.</p>
<p><strong>Settle every bet with certainty.</strong><br />
Scout-verified, blockchain-confirmed results mean zero ambiguity at settlement. When a result is on-chain, there is nothing left to dispute.</p>
