	<section
		class="basic-wysiwyg overflow-hidden relative center none  normal float-left w-full h-auto mt-none mb-medium">
		<div
			class="container px-[15px] relative z-[2] mx-auto  flex justify-center items-center  ">
			<div
				class="flex pt-[10px]  anime-scroll flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[20px]  max-w-[1000px] ">
									<h2 class="to-animate text-center">Developer-Ready Sports Data Infrastructure</h2>
				
									<div class="content to-animate w-full">
						<p>Whether you&#8217;re building a sportsbook, pricing prediction markets, or running a high-frequency trading desk, infrastructure matters. TxODDS delivers the sports odds API and low-latency sports data your systems depend on, built around developer-ready sports data APIs that integrate cleanly via JSON, without the usual friction of legacy data providers. Need to validate a model or stress-test a pricing strategy? Our historical odds archive gives quantitative teams the depth to backtest across millions of fixtures and years of market movement. From real-time feeds to prediction markets, every product in our suite is engineered for the teams that can&#8217;t afford to be wrong or slow.</p>
					</div>
				
							</div>
		</div>
	</section>

    
        
	<section
		class="accordions-section float-left w-full h-auto mt-none mb-medium">
		<div class="container px-[15px] mx-auto flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-[50px] anime-scroll">
							<h2 class="text-center to-animate">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
			
							<div class="accordions float-start w-full h-auto flex flex-col gap-[10px] max-w-[750px] anime-scroll">

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								What is TxODDS and what does it do?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">TxODDS is a global sports data provider built for the businesses that power modern betting. </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">We deliver real-time and historical sports data including a sports odds API, live trading feeds, </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">and verified in-play data to sportsbooks, platform providers, trading teams, and technology </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">companies worldwide. If your business depends on accurate, fast data, we built our products for </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">you.</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								What products does TxODDS offer?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
