							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Custom data integrations tailored to your existing stack</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Strategic consultancy for trading and operational performance</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">24/7 global technical support</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Scalable infrastructure for businesses at any stage</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Enterprise-grade security and data protection frameworks</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								Are TxODDS APIs developer-ready?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Yes. Our developer-ready sports data APIs are designed for clean, fast integration via JSON.</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								What sports does TxODDS cover?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">We provide comprehensive coverage across:</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Soccer</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">— Premier League, La Liga, Bundesliga, Serie A, MLS, Champions League, and</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">350+ leagues globally</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Horse &amp; Greyhound Racing</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">— UK, Irish, and international markets</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">US College Sports</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">— NCAA football and basketball with verified in-venue data</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Tennis</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">— ATP, WTA, Grand Slams</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Plus</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">— Basketball (NBA, EuroLeague), Rugby, American Football, Baseball, Golf, Ice</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Hockey, and more</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								Where does TxODDS operate?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">We deliver sports data solutions globally, including:</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Europe (UK, Germany, Spain, Italy, Scandinavia, Eastern Europe)</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">North America (United States, Canada)</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">South East Asia</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Africa (Nigeria, Kenya, South Africa)</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">South America (Brazil, Argentina, Chile)</span><br role="presentation" /><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">●</span> <span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Australia and New Zealand</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								How fast is TxODDS data delivery?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Tx FUSION ODDS delivers live odds updates in as little as 8–10 milliseconds — some of the </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">lowest latency available in the market. For trading desks where milliseconds translate directly </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">into margin, that speed is the product.</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								Does TxODDS support historical odds and backtesting?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Yes. Tx LAB is our dedicated historical odds and data archive, containing over 5 million </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">fixtures and decades of verified betting model data. It&#8217;s built specifically for quants, data </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">scientists, and trading teams who need reliable historical odds for model development, strategy </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">testing, and market analysis.</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								Can TxODDS support prediction markets and DFS platforms?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Yes. We work with operators in prediction markets, daily fantasy sports, and other emerging </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">formats. Our AI-assisted pricing models, low-latency event feeds, and calibrated probabilities </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">are designed to handle the speed and complexity these markets require.</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								Can TxODDS integrate with my existing systems?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Our APIs are built for flexible integration across sportsbooks, exchanges, trading platforms, </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">and custom technology stacks. If you have a specific integration requirement, our team will </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">scope it with you directly.</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								How is TxODDS pricing structured?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Pricing is built around your specific requirements — the sports you need, data volumes, </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">delivery method, and service level. Every partnership is scoped to deliver maximum value for </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">how your business actually operates. <a href="https://txodds.net/contact-txodds/">Book a call</a> and we&#8217;ll give you a clear picture.</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
							<div
								class="acc-title float-start w-full flex my-[-4px] items-center justify-between h-auto p-[25px] text-[22px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-custom-primary cursor-pointer relative">
								Does TxODDS provide 24/7 support?
								<i class="acc-arrow transition-all duration-300">

									<svg class="w-[14px] h-auto" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="9" viewBox="0 0 14 9" fill="none">
										<path d="M6.9982 8.49649L7.61176 7.9L13.3864 2.28947L14 1.69298L12.7729 0.503509L12.1593 1.1L6.9982 6.11754L1.83707 1.09649L1.22351 0.5L0 1.69298L0.61356 2.28947L6.38464 7.90351L6.9982 8.5V8.49649Z" fill="#052C3C"/>
									</svg>
								</i>
							</div>

							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">Yes. Our global support team operates around the clock to ensure uninterrupted service for </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">clients in every timezone.</span></p>
							</div>
						</div>

					
						<div
							class="accordion-section to-animate float-start w-full h-auto  bg-white rounded-[5px] border border-custom-border hover:border-custom-primary [&.active]:border-custom-primary transition-all duration-300">
