							<div
								class="acc-section content float-start w-full   px-[25px] pb-[30px] hidden">
								<p><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">We use enterprise-grade security frameworks, data encryption, and compliance protocols </span><span dir="ltr" role="presentation">across all client data and integrations.</span></p>
